==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Znache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cadaver Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**4 [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**3 [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
In spite of Cadaver Bear appearing here, the stage is overall not too threatening. You can use Cadaver Bear's burrow to your advantage and build a small offensive force before hitting the base to cheese the stage instead of fighting the Cadaver Bear head on. Though, Cadaver Bear has 4 knockbacks, so be careful not to cancel his burrow. Alternatively, most anti-Zombie ubers will work here. Money is tight on this stage, so be careful not to trigger the base too early.

